      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  25 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  45 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Beam</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user fires a beam out of their mouth powered by their own life force. Roll a <em>Beam Attack Roll</em> dealing 6d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. This attack may be used while <em>Grappled, Restrained,</em> or <em>Prone</em>.</p>\n",
